msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"It has been a week since the release of `1.13.0.Final` so it is time for our "
"traditional `.1` release."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"1.13.1.Final is a maintenance release fixing bugs and improving the "
"documentation."
msgstr ""

msgid "1.13.1.Final is a safe upgrade for everyone using Quarkus 1.13."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not using 1.13 already, please refer to the https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-1.13[1.13 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Instrumentation-based live reload disabled by default"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We have made several iterations of our instrumentation-based live reload "
"(meaning we don't restart Quarkus but just perform class redefinition when "
"we can) since its first introduction."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"It has matured a lot but we decided it was too much of a change compared to "
"our initial promise of \"you refresh, everything is fully restarted\".\n"
"So, in 1.13.1.Final, we disabled it by default.\n"
"If your live reloads are taking too long or if you want to keep the "
"application state as much as possible, you can enable it by adding `quarkus."
"live-reload.instrumentation=true` in your `application.properties`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/1.13.1."
"Final[the full changelog of 1.13.1.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
